---
title: Amish breakfast casserole
servings: 12
tags: [pork, make-ahead]
cuisine: american
time: 50 minutes
source: Amish Breakfast Casserole by Taste of Home, https://www.tasteofhome.com/recipes/amish-breakfast-casserole
nutrition:
  calories: 273 kcal
---

Heat the oven to 350°F. Cook the @bacon{1%lb}(diced) and @yellow onion{1}(chopped) in a #large skillet{} over medium heat until the bacon is crisp. Drain.

In a #large bowl{}, mix the @eggs{6}(lightly beaten), @frozen hash browns{4%cup}(thawed), @cheddar{2%cup}(shredded), @cottage cheese{1%cup}(4 percent) and @Swiss cheese{1 1/4%cup}(shredded). Stir in the bacon and onion.

Spread it in a greased #13x9-inch baking dish{} and bake uncovered ~{35%minutes} to 40 minutes, until a knife in the middle comes out clean.

Let it stand ~{10%minutes} to firm up before cutting.
